ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "The Fenland study is designed to investigate the interaction between genetic and lifestyle factors in determining diabetes, obesity, and related metabolic disorders.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://studies.epi.ims.cam.ac.uk/files/fenland-study/fenland2_pis-executive-function-v3-120219.pdf") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "lifestyle factors") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:is_designed_to_study_exposure obo:ECTO_6000015) coho:COHO_0000164)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "The study population was drawn from the THISEAS (The Hellenic Study of Interactions between Single Nucleotide Polymorphisms and Eating in Atherosclerosis Susceptibility) database, constituting a case-control cohort.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:38929788") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "eating") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:is_designed_to_study_exposure obo:ECTO_6000021) coho:COHO_0000171)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "These were that childhood cancer might be caused by: 1. a child's exposure to ionizing radiation (natural or man-made) either during the mother's pregnancy or after birth 2. similar exposure to potentially hazardous chemicals, some of which have been associated with specific cancers in adult life 3. exposure of the parental germ cells to either radiation or hazardous chemicals before the child's conception 4. extremely low frequency electromagnetic fields post-natally, particularly in the case of brain cancers and leukaemia") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:10737392") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "electric and magnetic fields") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:is_designed_to_study_exposure obo:ECTO_0000002) coho:COHO_0000178)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "Information about both groups of children (with and without cancer) has been obtained from parental questionnaires, general practitioners' and hospital records, and from measurement of the extent of exposure to radon gas, terrestrial gamma radiation, and electric and magnetic fields.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:10737392") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "terrestrial gamma radiation") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:is_designed_to_study_exposure obo:ECTO_8000045) coho:COHO_0000178)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In particular, consent was sought for their participation in both the ionizing radiation (radon and gamma) and the non-ionizing radiation (EMF) components of the study (Figure 2).") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:10737392") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "radon gas") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:is_designed_to_study_exposure obo:ECTO_9000097) coho:COHO_0000178)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "We do so by determining the global estimates of ancestry for children with and without asthma from the Genetic Asthma Susceptibility to Indoor Pollution in Peru (GASP study), and evaluating if these global ancestry estimates are associated with asthma status, lung function and total serum IgE levels (IgE).") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:33713768") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "indoor pollution") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:is_designed_to_study_exposure obo:ECTO_8000036) coho:COHO_0000199)
