ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In this report from the EIRA study we investigated aspects of the association between smoking and the risk for RA that have previously only been investigated to a limited extent,and that may have relevance for the creation of biological hypoth- eses, focusing on the inﬂuence of RF status, sex, duration and intensity of smoking, and smoking cessation.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:12922955") Annotation(obo:IAO_0000116 "cigarette smoking") ObjectSomeValuesFrom(coho:is_designed_to_study_exposure obo:ECTO_6000038) coho:COHO_0000458)
